{% macro text(b) %}
Here's what I can do with the Nova Scotia UARB matter database:

- Documents: name a matter and a type, for example "Other Documents from {{ b.example }}". I'll reply with a summary of the matter and up to {{ b.batch }} documents as a ZIP.
- Summary: send just the matter number to get its details and document counts.
- MORE: reply in the same thread for the next {{ b.batch }}.
- GET <document number>: reply in the same thread for one specific document.
- WATCH {{ b.example }}: I'll email you when something new is filed. UNWATCH {{ b.example }} stops it.

The types are {{ b.types }}.
{% endmacro %}

